WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps,
I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes,
I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes,
I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone,
whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases.
I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.480
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.480 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel,
Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 6]

01:51.700 --> 01:52.820
Is all this really necessary?

01:53.620 --> 01:55.220
Weren't you afraid
she'd actually kill you?

01:55.860 --> 01:56.500
Kill me?

01:58.660 --> 02:00.180
It would plunge the court into chaos.

02:01.420 --> 02:02.380
Her Highness was just trying

02:02.380 --> 02:03.420
to humiliate me

02:05.060 --> 02:06.260
and vent her spite.

02:07.820 --> 02:10.060
So, are you breaking the pact

02:10.980 --> 02:12.860
and making her your enemy?

02:13.940 --> 02:14.660
The pact?

02:15.940 --> 02:17.420
Since when has she ever cared for that?

02:18.540 --> 02:19.860
She handed the Imperial Guard Tally

02:19.860 --> 02:20.500
to a nobody

02:20.500 --> 02:22.220
from the Xie Family.

02:22.300 --> 02:23.780
Is that her idea of sincerity?

02:24.140 --> 02:25.900
If you had held the Tally,

02:27.060 --> 02:27.780
she

02:28.180 --> 02:29.540
would have had
even less chance of survival.

02:36.940 --> 02:38.100
Xiao Xun cannot die.

02:41.700 --> 02:43.100
At least not yet.

02:43.940 --> 02:44.740
Why?

03:04.140 --> 03:05.860
Is this the fallback you mentioned?​

03:07.340 --> 03:08.660
The late Emperor's final edict.

03:08.980 --> 03:10.860
Xiao Xun

03:10.980 --> 03:11.940
was the designated heir.

03:12.500 --> 03:13.220
It was

03:13.780 --> 03:15.660
​due to unforeseen complications

03:16.420 --> 03:18.060
that the crown

03:18.700 --> 03:19.900
passed to Xiao Yu.

03:21.840 --> 03:23.660
[One day ago]

03:23.660 --> 03:24.140
Your Highness.

03:27.620 --> 03:30.700
My gates have been so deserted

03:31.420 --> 03:32.580
that even the sparrows

03:32.580 --> 03:33.700
give this place a wide berth.

03:34.380 --> 03:35.060
It is truly rare

03:35.980 --> 03:37.980
that you would actually reach out

03:38.620 --> 03:40.100
to Tie Ying.

03:40.660 --> 03:42.100
Your Highness, have you ever heard of

03:43.860 --> 03:45.180
greatness biding its time in the depths?

03:48.900 --> 03:50.580
Mr. Deng, are you here

03:51.580 --> 03:52.260
to teach me

03:53.740 --> 03:55.340
fortune-reading?

03:56.460 --> 03:57.540
It is a pity

03:58.740 --> 04:00.140
that your judgment has failed you

04:02.340 --> 04:04.060
because there is no greatness

04:05.100 --> 04:06.220
to be found here.

04:08.020 --> 04:09.140
​I am naught but a lamb​

04:09.780 --> 04:11.740
​to the slaughter.​

04:12.460 --> 04:12.860
No.

04:14.300 --> 04:15.500
I am here

04:15.500 --> 04:16.420
to show you

04:18.260 --> 04:20.180
a path to Xiaonan,

04:21.300 --> 04:22.220
also a path to help

04:23.180 --> 04:24.980
reclaim your former glory.

04:38.580 --> 04:39.780
Why help me?

04:42.580 --> 04:44.900
The imperial court
has always been a treacherous place

04:45.420 --> 04:46.500
of shifting tides.

04:47.100 --> 04:48.580
I don't dare to stake everything

04:48.580 --> 04:49.620
on a single play.

04:50.100 --> 04:51.060
That was true then

04:51.660 --> 04:52.820
as it is now.

04:54.860 --> 04:55.740
I am aiding you

04:56.620 --> 04:57.540
because I hold

04:57.540 --> 04:59.340
a far more compelling hand.

05:08.420 --> 05:09.780
This is the late Emperor's final edict.

05:09.980 --> 05:12.340
You were the one
meant to inherit the throne.

05:16.020 --> 05:17.380
​Indeed, Your Highness.​

05:18.140 --> 05:19.420
This is a forgery.

05:19.580 --> 05:19.940
You...

05:20.220 --> 05:21.820
But I have the true one, too.

05:23.420 --> 05:25.100
His Majesty
has barely ascended the throne.

05:25.980 --> 05:28.020
Aren't you afraid of
being branded a rebel?

05:30.860 --> 05:31.820
Precision is required to strike

05:32.660 --> 05:33.900
and clarity is needed to lead.

05:34.820 --> 05:36.380
I aligned with Chu Zhao

05:37.100 --> 05:38.780
for a promise

05:39.500 --> 05:40.860
she later broke,

05:41.620 --> 05:42.620
prompting my shift

05:42.620 --> 05:44.020
to Your Highness.

05:44.900 --> 05:46.660
My goal has stayed

05:46.660 --> 05:47.860
the same throughout.

05:48.300 --> 05:48.900
Are you

05:50.060 --> 05:51.500
aware now, Your Highness?

05:54.300 --> 05:54.940
When I claim

05:55.420 --> 05:56.620
my destiny,

05:57.700 --> 05:59.220
the seat of Grand Mentor shall be yours.

06:07.540 --> 06:08.100
Mr. Deng,

06:08.340 --> 06:08.980
you have a visitor.

06:20.940 --> 06:22.340
So

06:23.500 --> 06:25.580
you've prepared your own coffin?

06:26.620 --> 06:27.420
How kind of you

06:27.420 --> 06:28.780
to save the court the expense.

06:29.780 --> 06:31.940
Such prime golden-thread nanmu.

06:32.660 --> 06:33.820
Not really.

06:34.900 --> 06:36.660
It was bestowed by Her Highness.

06:37.020 --> 06:38.140
I heard

06:38.660 --> 06:40.060
when the late Emperor
crushed the old dynasty,

06:40.540 --> 06:41.660
​the fallen ruler

06:41.900 --> 06:43.660
used this very timber​

06:44.300 --> 06:45.820
​to immolate himself for his state.

06:48.220 --> 06:48.980
I spoke inappropriately.

06:49.460 --> 06:50.100
What

06:51.140 --> 06:52.700
brings you here, exactly?

06:55.180 --> 06:56.540
There is a matter

06:57.620 --> 06:58.580
I'm hoping

06:59.940 --> 07:01.660
you could shed some light on.

07:09.860 --> 07:10.700
Do you know

07:11.180 --> 07:12.220
Her Highness has besieged

07:12.220 --> 07:13.700
the heir to the Lord of Xiaonan?

07:14.900 --> 07:15.620
Of course.

07:16.020 --> 07:17.500
Do you also know

07:18.700 --> 07:19.500
that Xiao Xun

07:20.140 --> 07:20.700
has escaped?

07:21.100 --> 07:21.620
I do.

07:25.140 --> 07:26.980
Do you know

07:29.260 --> 07:30.420
who let him go?

07:31.540 --> 07:32.660
It was me.

07:37.380 --> 07:38.940
Your honesty

07:39.940 --> 07:43.260
is quite touching.

07:43.980 --> 07:45.660
Such an act proves

07:46.580 --> 07:48.580
you have turned against Her Highness.

07:49.540 --> 07:50.980
But have you considered

07:52.420 --> 07:54.180
the weight of this coffin?

07:56.460 --> 07:57.860
Can you carry it

07:59.260 --> 08:00.580
alone?

08:01.660 --> 08:03.660
​You came through the midnight rain

08:04.580 --> 08:05.740
only for this?​

08:07.140 --> 08:08.340
I was wondering

08:08.940 --> 08:10.820
if I were the one
letting Xiao Xun walk free,

08:11.580 --> 08:12.540
would she have brought

08:13.420 --> 08:15.220
this coffin

08:15.300 --> 08:17.300
through my Xie Clan's front door?

08:18.740 --> 08:19.580
Mr. Deng,

08:20.500 --> 08:23.180
playing with fire
without a clan's backing is folly.

08:24.740 --> 08:27.020
Beware you don't get burned.

08:28.660 --> 08:30.740
I've long heard
your mastery of the board is unrivaled.

08:31.780 --> 08:33.620
Might I invite you for a round?

08:38.940 --> 08:40.380
It would be my honor.

08:44.550 --> 08:47.240
[Military Camp of Yunzhong Prefecture]

08:47.740 --> 08:48.220
General,

08:48.500 --> 08:49.940
the Northern Desert forces
know our defenses

08:49.940 --> 08:50.820
inside out.

08:51.300 --> 08:52.260
They even have the exact locations

08:52.260 --> 08:53.300
of our hidden sentries.

08:53.740 --> 08:55.060
We must have a traitor.

08:56.940 --> 08:57.580
Report!

09:01.540 --> 09:02.060
Report.

09:02.220 --> 09:03.100
Urgent news from the Capital.

09:03.260 --> 09:04.940
Her Highness faces impeachment.​​

09:05.100 --> 09:06.420
The heir to the Lord of Xiaonan
has fled by night.​​

09:06.580 --> 09:07.980
​Imperial Guard Commander Fu Jiu
is wounded.

09:08.180 --> 09:09.180
Is Jiu's condition severe?

09:09.460 --> 09:09.860
Word is

09:09.980 --> 09:10.860
the Imperial Physicians have consulted

09:11.020 --> 09:11.980
and he is out of danger.

09:12.260 --> 09:13.180
Is Zhao safe and sound?

09:13.660 --> 09:14.380
Her Highness is unharmed.​

09:20.580 --> 09:22.340
Xiao Xun fled back to Xiaonan,

09:22.980 --> 09:24.060
and now the Northern Desert invades

09:24.580 --> 09:26.660
with such intimate knowledge
of our defenses.

09:28.700 --> 09:29.460
Could it be

09:30.660 --> 09:32.020
a betrayal from within?

09:33.500 --> 09:33.980
Pass the order.

09:35.180 --> 09:35.780
The Third Battalion

09:36.380 --> 09:37.180
is to redeploy to Langya Valley.

09:37.620 --> 09:38.740
The Fifth is to set an ambush
at Yingzui Cliff.

09:39.500 --> 09:40.980
Adjust the defensive line as planned.

09:41.820 --> 09:43.340
Position the hidden troops

09:44.500 --> 09:46.140
and wait for them to take the bait.

09:46.540 --> 09:47.260
​​- Understood! - Understood!​

09:51.740 --> 09:52.260
General!

09:56.500 --> 09:57.020
General,

09:57.180 --> 09:58.660
what is this malady?

09:58.860 --> 10:00.460
It worsens by the day.

10:01.020 --> 10:01.740
Even medicine

10:01.740 --> 10:02.740
offers no relief.

10:04.020 --> 10:04.780
It's nothing.

10:06.260 --> 10:07.180
I'll lead the charge

10:08.260 --> 10:09.260
tomorrow.

10:09.740 --> 10:11.220
No. You can barely stand.

10:11.380 --> 10:12.140
This is an order.

10:13.860 --> 10:15.140
An order is an order.

10:17.100 --> 10:17.580
Yes.

10:26.860 --> 10:27.620
Your Highness,

10:28.380 --> 10:30.220
Mr. Xie has been recovering here

10:30.260 --> 10:31.180
for three days now.

10:31.860 --> 10:33.620
Though your title ​leaves

10:33.620 --> 10:34.860
few who dare​ to criticize you,

10:35.620 --> 10:38.420
the boundaries of decorum remain.

10:38.740 --> 10:40.620
I fear the idle tongues outside

10:40.740 --> 10:42.460
are already beginning to wag.

10:45.620 --> 10:47.060
Since I entered these imperial walls,

10:48.220 --> 10:49.780
when have the rumors ever stopped?

10:52.740 --> 10:53.660
The Censorate

10:53.740 --> 10:55.420
is bent on branding me

10:55.620 --> 10:56.740
a hen ruling the roost.

10:59.500 --> 11:00.060
Besides,

11:01.260 --> 11:02.540
his injuries are deep.

11:03.380 --> 11:04.140
I won't risk

11:05.380 --> 11:06.460
leaving him

11:07.380 --> 11:08.100
to others.

11:09.020 --> 11:11.100
Is it because
Your Highness has feelings for him

11:11.740 --> 11:13.380
that you refused

11:13.500 --> 11:14.940
to marry Mr. Xiao?

11:19.260 --> 11:20.420
After all our time together,

11:20.860 --> 11:21.780
is that truly how you see me?

11:22.340 --> 11:23.060
No.

11:23.340 --> 11:24.540
I spoke out of turn.

11:24.540 --> 11:25.340
I swear.

11:25.860 --> 11:26.980
Please, do not be angry.

11:31.500 --> 11:33.140
​Every string in this palace

11:34.260 --> 11:35.220
must be mine to pull.​

11:38.860 --> 11:40.460
But he is more than just a pawn.

11:42.860 --> 11:43.660
He is...

11:46.660 --> 11:47.300
different.

11:48.380 --> 11:49.180
How?

11:52.860 --> 11:53.700
I used him,

11:54.620 --> 11:55.700
and yet, I trust him

11:56.740 --> 11:57.700
more than anyone else.

12:04.140 --> 12:04.740
Regardless,

12:07.980 --> 12:08.540
he is different.

12:13.460 --> 12:14.700
Urgent news from the frontier!

12:14.780 --> 12:16.020
The Northern Desert
has attacked Yunzhong.

12:19.620 --> 12:20.020
No.

12:21.900 --> 12:23.060
My report was a forgery.

12:24.740 --> 12:25.860
How could it possibly be real?

12:33.620 --> 12:35.380
Since Her Highness forged the report

12:35.380 --> 12:38.940
of collusion between the Lord of Xiaonan
and the Northern Desert,

12:39.900 --> 12:41.300
and tried to drag my family into this

12:41.460 --> 12:42.900
using Pine Soot Ink,

12:43.340 --> 12:44.540
she should have been prepared

12:44.740 --> 12:45.700
for the possibility that her scheme

12:45.740 --> 12:46.820
could spark a real war.

12:48.300 --> 12:48.990
Playing the game,

12:49.940 --> 12:51.260
one must always keep a backup plan.

12:54.780 --> 12:56.180
You look refined,

12:57.740 --> 12:59.220
yet your style of play is ruthless.

13:00.260 --> 13:01.380
You flatter me.

13:02.980 --> 13:03.700
I just

13:03.700 --> 13:04.980
dislike wasting time.

13:06.740 --> 13:07.580
However,

13:09.020 --> 13:09.980
patience

13:11.380 --> 13:13.540
is the true essence of Weiqi games.

13:21.660 --> 13:23.420
At the start of this match,

13:24.140 --> 13:25.380
you were full of confidence,

13:26.780 --> 13:27.340
weren't you?

13:32.340 --> 13:33.700
But look at it now.

13:35.180 --> 13:36.620
The situation has changed.

13:44.380 --> 13:45.780
Do my skills

13:46.580 --> 13:47.940
meet with your approval?

13:52.900 --> 13:54.540
Your skill

13:55.700 --> 13:56.580
is exceptional.

13:56.620 --> 13:57.620
Good.

13:58.620 --> 14:00.220
Since you enjoy watching,

14:01.060 --> 14:02.580
I shall set several games in motion.

14:03.500 --> 14:05.420
​But a board too full
leaves no clear opening.​​

14:06.780 --> 14:09.740
​Beware lest you find no way out.​

15:40.380 --> 15:41.020
You're awake.

15:45.580 --> 15:46.780
Are you in any pain?

15:48.740 --> 15:50.300
I failed my mission.

15:52.740 --> 15:53.980
I've dragged you down with me

15:54.980 --> 15:56.140
and gotten you injured.

15:59.540 --> 16:00.660
Deng Yi sent his men

16:00.980 --> 16:02.060
to issue orders at the docks,

16:02.500 --> 16:03.300
which gave Xiao Xun

16:03.300 --> 16:04.660
a chance to escape by water.

16:06.020 --> 16:06.740
I thought

16:07.620 --> 16:08.940
it was foolproof.

16:09.660 --> 16:10.340
Yet...

16:12.980 --> 16:14.060
​The game at court​

16:15.380 --> 16:16.700
​is never that simple.​

16:18.300 --> 16:19.500
Such is the nature of power.

16:20.580 --> 16:21.100
Tell me.

16:21.820 --> 16:23.260
How do you want me to repay this debt?

16:24.060 --> 16:25.780
I can grant you one wish.

16:33.660 --> 16:35.500
I've never believed in divinity.

16:36.540 --> 16:37.420
I have no wishes.

16:38.820 --> 16:39.500
Then

16:40.340 --> 16:41.140
is there nothing

16:41.140 --> 16:42.460
you wish to achieve?

16:47.580 --> 16:48.020
No.

16:50.500 --> 16:51.020
Very well.

16:51.660 --> 16:54.220
Then let the debt stand for now.​

16:54.860 --> 16:55.740
When you decide

16:56.180 --> 16:56.860
what you want,

16:57.340 --> 16:58.220
just come to me.

17:11.020 --> 17:12.220
With your skills,

17:12.380 --> 17:13.580
you shouldn't be this badly hurt.

17:15.780 --> 17:16.660
What really happened

17:17.020 --> 17:18.020
that day?

17:21.780 --> 17:22.580
Tie Ying

17:24.780 --> 17:25.860
used hidden weapons.

17:27.740 --> 17:29.420
I let my guard down and got ambushed.

17:30.180 --> 17:30.740
Just as I thought.

17:32.020 --> 17:33.060
They only resort to

17:33.060 --> 17:34.220
such despicable tricks.

17:40.660 --> 17:42.060
Last night,
I saw you having a nightmare.

17:43.300 --> 17:44.740
You seemed burdened by something.

17:46.020 --> 17:46.900
As you said,

17:48.380 --> 17:49.420
everyone has

17:49.900 --> 17:50.860
their own secrets.

17:51.940 --> 17:52.580
True.

17:53.620 --> 17:54.620
But I shared mine

17:54.620 --> 17:55.380
with you.

17:56.740 --> 17:58.700
You mean that dream?

18:09.540 --> 18:09.940
Alright.

18:11.020 --> 18:12.060
As an exchange,

18:13.660 --> 18:14.860
I'll tell you a secret.

18:22.700 --> 18:23.460
Actually...

18:28.260 --> 18:28.780
I...

18:58.660 --> 18:59.740
I once sneaked a bite

18:59.780 --> 19:01.260
of the jujube cakes
you got for your father,

19:02.060 --> 19:02.940
and paid for it with a beating.​

19:05.020 --> 19:06.300
Thank you for sharing that.

19:07.940 --> 19:08.740
It's just...

19:10.700 --> 19:12.340
I'll never make that again.

19:19.020 --> 19:19.540
No matter.

19:21.500 --> 19:23.020
I never liked

19:23.020 --> 19:23.660
those pastries anyway.

19:26.500 --> 19:28.580
I was thinking of making you

19:28.620 --> 19:29.740
something else to eat.

19:32.380 --> 19:32.860
Sounds good.

19:58.580 --> 19:59.020
Jiu,

20:00.420 --> 20:01.260
my hairpin is a bit askew.

20:01.900 --> 20:03.420
Fix it for me, would you?

20:50.060 --> 20:53.900
♪Day after day,
across these ancient hills♪

20:53.900 --> 20:57.660
♪Again and again,
the old city cold and still♪

20:57.660 --> 21:00.460
♪Through dust and battle, I look back♪

21:00.460 --> 21:03.960
♪And find you waiting at journey's end♪

21:05.260 --> 21:09.100
♪Night after night, the hours drift on♪

21:09.100 --> 21:12.860
♪Year after year,
our reunions end too soon♪

21:12.860 --> 21:18.760
♪Love so deep, yet fate so thin,
why must it be so hard?♪

21:19.320 --> 21:23.280
♪Through joy and sorrow,
we have shared it all♪

21:23.280 --> 21:27.160
♪Bound by a knowing no words can name♪

21:27.160 --> 21:30.900
♪Two lonely souls,
huddling together for warmth♪

21:31.060 --> 21:34.620
♪A fleeting embrace amidst the chaos♪

21:34.820 --> 21:38.540
♪You say this life is naught
but endless partings♪

21:38.540 --> 21:42.300
♪I sigh at the whims of merciless fate♪

21:42.580 --> 21:46.180
♪I'm holding on alone♪

21:46.180 --> 21:48.980
♪Yet across the vast divide♪

21:49.020 --> 21:49.540
Good, right?

21:50.460 --> 21:51.540
Six hours at the stove,

21:51.820 --> 21:52.860
​steamer after steamer,

21:53.540 --> 21:54.420
all for ​a flawless batch.

21:56.100 --> 21:57.580
It's truly the finest delicacy

21:58.220 --> 21:59.180
in the world.

22:00.020 --> 22:01.660
You should've mixed
the filling properly.

22:02.740 --> 22:04.300
The ratio of lard has to be exact.

22:05.060 --> 22:06.380
Too little or too much ruins it.

22:07.940 --> 22:08.660
I see.

22:09.500 --> 22:10.380
My father always said

22:11.220 --> 22:12.180
too little makes it dry

22:12.700 --> 22:13.660
and too much makes it greasy.

22:23.700 --> 22:25.260
It's my fault.

22:28.460 --> 22:30.220
I have been away from Yunzhong
for so long

22:32.940 --> 22:33.700
that I have forgotten

22:37.980 --> 22:39.100
the recipe.

22:41.180 --> 22:42.100
In fact,

22:43.220 --> 22:44.100
I was never very skilled

22:46.420 --> 22:48.020
at making these pastries to begin with.

22:53.580 --> 22:55.780
Father, see? I made it.

22:56.100 --> 22:57.660
I finally mastered jujube cakes.

22:59.420 --> 23:01.060
Well done.

23:02.660 --> 23:03.420
Just try not to sneak

23:03.660 --> 23:04.780
the filling next time.

23:11.340 --> 23:12.540
Father, don't scare me.

23:12.580 --> 23:14.060
I just missed my mother.

23:14.340 --> 23:15.820
I didn't grow up by her side.

23:15.820 --> 23:16.940
So I wanted to take a look.

23:17.460 --> 23:18.820
To look at the sights she saw

23:18.820 --> 23:20.500
and walk the lanes she walked.

23:20.700 --> 23:22.180
If Mother were still alive,

23:22.940 --> 23:24.220
she wouldn't want me

23:24.260 --> 23:25.500
to be an obedient girl.

23:26.020 --> 23:27.700
She wouldn't be as arrogant as you.

23:28.580 --> 23:30.340
She would care about my feelings.

23:31.780 --> 23:32.380
Yeah.

23:33.180 --> 23:34.180
You're the undefeated

23:34.220 --> 23:35.140
God of War.

23:35.580 --> 23:37.340
You're the esteemed Guard General.

23:37.500 --> 23:39.340
You're busy protecting frontier people.

23:39.460 --> 23:41.300
You're busy forging your fame.

23:41.980 --> 23:42.740
You're too busy

23:43.260 --> 23:44.420
to ask your daughter

23:44.460 --> 23:46.260
what she really wants!

23:50.940 --> 23:51.900
Missing someone

23:53.540 --> 23:54.780
is nothing to be ashamed of.

23:58.060 --> 23:59.220
And neither is being homesick.

24:20.300 --> 24:21.660
During the years I spent
by your father's side,

24:23.220 --> 24:24.420
he seemed truly content.

24:26.260 --> 24:27.580
He kept himself busy,

24:29.820 --> 24:30.580
but whenever he got rare spices

24:30.580 --> 24:31.580
from the Western Regions,

24:33.060 --> 24:33.740
he would tuck them away

24:33.740 --> 24:34.900
in the room at the southern courtyard.

24:36.260 --> 24:37.380
When he went out on patrol,

24:38.460 --> 24:39.700
if he saw a lovely sprig of blossoms,

24:40.900 --> 24:41.780
he would bring it back

24:43.060 --> 24:44.500
to plant in that courtyard.

24:45.340 --> 24:46.420
He told me

24:47.460 --> 24:48.540
it was

24:48.540 --> 24:49.300
where you once lived,

24:50.020 --> 24:51.300
and so he kept it in order
for your return.​

24:58.260 --> 24:58.860
Chu Zhao.

25:02.020 --> 25:03.060
Your father never blamed you

25:04.500 --> 25:05.740
for your leaving.

25:07.540 --> 25:08.620
He only wanted to know

25:09.380 --> 25:10.540
whether you were doing well.

25:12.940 --> 25:14.100
He has missed you, that's all.

25:16.580 --> 25:17.220
You don't have to

25:17.220 --> 25:18.180
respond

25:19.340 --> 25:20.260
to any of this.

25:21.820 --> 25:23.340
These are his feelings to carry.

25:25.300 --> 25:26.660
So please don't be too hard on yourself.

25:27.860 --> 25:28.740
No one

25:29.700 --> 25:31.300
needs to be forgiven.

25:32.940 --> 25:33.620
Actually,

25:36.860 --> 25:38.580
I miss him terribly too

25:40.340 --> 25:41.860
and everything about the desert.

25:48.220 --> 25:49.460
He is a man

25:50.180 --> 25:50.860
of stern discipline

25:52.140 --> 25:53.060
yet with a tender heart.

25:56.660 --> 25:57.540
Much like you.

26:05.300 --> 26:06.020
The first time

26:06.020 --> 26:07.700
he took me to the desert poplar forest,

26:08.900 --> 26:10.980
he said every withered branch there

26:12.060 --> 26:13.540
was fighting desperately to stay alive,

26:14.460 --> 26:16.100
which is what shaped
this timeless landscape.

26:18.420 --> 26:19.460
Dying is easy.

26:23.460 --> 26:24.780
Living takes true strength.

26:27.260 --> 26:27.940
Jiu.

26:31.220 --> 26:31.700
My apologies.

26:33.020 --> 26:34.060
I've said too much.

26:34.900 --> 26:35.580
Not at all.

26:37.820 --> 26:39.420
I'm glad to hear you

26:40.380 --> 26:41.300
speak your mind.

26:45.100 --> 26:45.860
It's late and cold.

26:47.220 --> 26:48.180
Please get some rest, Your Highness.

26:49.820 --> 26:50.620
Thank you

26:52.420 --> 26:53.420
for telling me

26:53.420 --> 26:54.460
about my father

26:55.580 --> 26:56.900
and for sharing your past

26:56.900 --> 26:57.780
with me.

26:59.740 --> 27:00.340
You are welcome.

27:02.540 --> 27:03.780
Consider it repayment

27:05.900 --> 27:06.580
for that pastry.

27:10.180 --> 27:10.940
Then

27:11.420 --> 27:12.340
please take this box

27:12.620 --> 27:13.420
of red bean cakes.

27:15.300 --> 27:15.820
I appreciate it.

27:18.020 --> 27:19.500
What I said today still stands.

27:23.180 --> 27:23.900
From now on,

27:24.900 --> 27:26.060
whatever wish you hold,

27:26.500 --> 27:27.580
you may ask it of me.

27:28.460 --> 27:30.100
Come fire or high water,

27:30.900 --> 27:32.020
I will see it fulfilled.

27:36.780 --> 27:37.620
I honor

27:38.260 --> 27:39.220
my promises

27:39.500 --> 27:40.380
and never renege.​

27:42.860 --> 27:43.300
Alright.

27:44.780 --> 27:45.300
I understand.

27:47.460 --> 27:48.180
Report!

27:49.940 --> 27:50.580
Report!

27:52.260 --> 27:52.860
Your Highness,

27:53.100 --> 27:54.100
urgent news from Yunzhong.

27:54.300 --> 27:55.460
The Northern Desert invaded yesterday.

27:55.700 --> 27:57.180
General Chu drove them back,

27:57.500 --> 27:58.580
but collapsed shortly after.

27:58.620 --> 27:59.540
He hasn't woken up.

28:01.940 --> 28:02.460
General.

28:02.740 --> 28:03.820
The enemy has withdrawn!

28:04.500 --> 28:06.380
Exactly as you predicted.

28:06.940 --> 28:09.260
Your foresight secured our victory.​

28:18.380 --> 28:18.860
General.

28:29.960 --> 28:33.640
[Prince of Xiaonan's Residence]

28:44.900 --> 28:45.340
Father.

28:52.740 --> 28:53.700
Are you hurt?

28:56.420 --> 28:57.380
You may not know,

28:58.140 --> 28:58.980
but Chu Ling's daughter

28:59.660 --> 29:01.140
seeks to finish me off for good.

29:02.180 --> 29:03.620
Chu Ling's daughter?

29:05.020 --> 29:06.620
The one who refused to marry you

29:06.700 --> 29:08.260
and only ever wanted
to be the Grand Princess?

29:09.980 --> 29:12.260
The throne changes and chaos follows.

29:12.980 --> 29:15.260
We and Yunzhong
hold each other in check.

29:16.220 --> 29:18.300
The Xie Clan of Gaoyang
eyes us with greed.

29:19.180 --> 29:20.260
Yet she moved first to purge

29:20.260 --> 29:22.060
our army in the Capital,

29:22.900 --> 29:23.980
then used your plight

29:23.980 --> 29:25.420
to build her power in the court.

29:26.740 --> 29:27.940
Such methods

29:28.820 --> 29:30.300
are truly masterful.

29:30.620 --> 29:31.940
This upheaval plunges

29:32.420 --> 29:33.980
the Capital into chaos.​

29:34.780 --> 29:35.380
Perhaps we...

29:35.420 --> 29:37.020
The essence of alchemy lies

29:37.300 --> 29:39.340
within the mastery of fire.

29:40.140 --> 29:41.780
When the Yellow Emperor
forged his cauldron,

29:41.940 --> 29:43.940
the Loong's roar emerged after 49 days.

29:44.420 --> 29:45.460
When the alchemists refined mercury,

29:45.660 --> 29:47.740
the rosy aura condensed after 81 nights.

29:48.340 --> 29:50.340
It all comes down to the precise moment.

29:51.140 --> 29:52.420
Opening the cauldron before completion

29:52.620 --> 29:54.460
risks failure.

29:56.120 --> 29:57.940
[Xiao Hong,
Prince of Xiaonan Prefecture]

29:57.940 --> 29:59.900
You must be weary from the road.

30:00.620 --> 30:02.020
Get some rest.

30:03.940 --> 30:04.500
Yes.

30:19.020 --> 30:20.380
General Chu Ling

30:20.860 --> 30:24.500
shall be held negligent
for the Northern Desert's incursion.

30:24.980 --> 30:26.900
Yes, they breached our frontiers,

30:27.580 --> 30:29.260
but it is also true General Chu led them

30:29.260 --> 30:29.980
into a void.

30:30.420 --> 30:31.540
No reward for his merit,

30:32.060 --> 30:33.380
yet only a trial for his fault?

30:33.900 --> 30:35.100
Since he took command,

30:35.300 --> 30:38.060
victory has been his solemn duty.

30:38.700 --> 30:40.020
Had Yunzhong fallen,

30:40.260 --> 30:42.140
the consequences
would've been catastrophic.

30:42.500 --> 30:44.620
Merit cannot offset
such a grave failing.

30:45.260 --> 30:45.980
Your Majesty,

30:46.820 --> 30:48.700
Chu Ling has been lax
in disciplining his troops

30:49.100 --> 30:50.380
and must be held to account.

30:50.460 --> 30:54.660
- Seconded. - Seconded.

30:55.740 --> 30:56.740
Chamberlain,

30:56.780 --> 30:58.380
your concern for the state
is commendable.

30:58.780 --> 31:00.180
But I must ask this.

31:00.940 --> 31:01.780
No sooner

31:02.300 --> 31:04.060
had Xiao Xun fled back to Xiaonan,

31:04.460 --> 31:06.180
than the invasion happened.

31:06.860 --> 31:07.980
​Is this striking coincidence

31:08.740 --> 31:10.900
proof of collusion from within?​

31:12.380 --> 31:13.460
Your Highness

31:13.460 --> 31:14.580
reminded me of something.

31:15.180 --> 31:16.340
As I recall,

31:16.860 --> 31:19.140
Mr. Deng argued most fervently
for Xiao Xun's pardon,

31:19.900 --> 31:21.020
claiming it was to appease

31:21.620 --> 31:23.260
the Lord of Xiaonan.

31:24.020 --> 31:24.900
Such impeccable timing

31:25.700 --> 31:27.740
for a show of mercy.

31:29.260 --> 31:30.740
Watch your words, Mr. Xie.

31:31.500 --> 31:33.820
His Majesty decreed

31:34.300 --> 31:35.700
Xiao Xun's pardon and return.

31:36.180 --> 31:37.300
Who am I to challenge

31:37.380 --> 31:38.420
the throne?

31:39.620 --> 31:40.740
Word has it

31:41.860 --> 31:44.300
you've set your sights

31:45.460 --> 31:46.780
on Xiao Xun's residence.

31:47.380 --> 31:49.220
It is a place

31:49.300 --> 31:50.660
of great vantage.

31:50.820 --> 31:53.460
Better to use it than waste it.

31:54.420 --> 31:55.380
His Majesty, in his infinite mercy,

31:55.660 --> 31:56.460
bestowed it upon me.

31:57.060 --> 31:57.460
What?

31:59.260 --> 32:00.420
You wish for it as well?

32:00.740 --> 32:01.260
Enough.

32:02.180 --> 32:03.180
With the Northern Desert encroaching,

32:03.300 --> 32:05.060
our priority is to steady the troops.

32:06.180 --> 32:07.420
As for the cancer within...

32:12.900 --> 32:14.940
I shall see for myself

32:15.900 --> 32:17.220
who is so desperate

32:18.460 --> 32:20.500
to usher in the enemy.

32:24.620 --> 32:25.460
I am weary.​

32:26.100 --> 32:27.340
​Should you have no other matters,​​

32:27.860 --> 32:28.820
​you may take your leave.​

32:29.860 --> 32:31.540
- We bid farewell to Your Majesty
- We bid farewell to Your Majesty

32:31.700 --> 32:33.420
- and Your Highness.
- and Your Highness.

32:57.860 --> 32:59.860
Who would have thought Xie Yanfang

33:00.860 --> 33:02.940
would show his hand so brazenly?

33:04.540 --> 33:05.700
Since he dared tell you

33:06.020 --> 33:07.540
he would bring

33:07.740 --> 33:09.420
the Grand Princess a true war,

33:09.660 --> 33:11.540
he clearly fears nothing,

33:12.180 --> 33:13.540
knowing we lack the evidence

33:14.380 --> 33:16.020
to move against him.

33:18.020 --> 33:18.700
Indeed.

33:19.860 --> 33:21.300
The very fact he said it

33:21.820 --> 33:22.460
proves he has

33:22.540 --> 33:23.700
​a contingency plan in place.

33:24.860 --> 33:26.580
Even if we sent men to investigate now,

33:27.500 --> 33:28.740
they would find nothing.

33:29.540 --> 33:31.900
Xie Yanfang is guarded
like an iron fortress.

33:32.940 --> 33:34.780
But even the tightest defense
has a flaw.

33:35.380 --> 33:37.220
​Why not start

33:37.620 --> 33:38.980
by digging into his place in Gaoyang?​

33:39.620 --> 33:40.900
When he came to the Capital,

33:42.060 --> 33:43.220
he brought ​all his men​

33:43.260 --> 33:44.380
with him.

33:44.940 --> 33:45.980
​The rest

33:46.060 --> 33:47.340
at the Gaoyang estate

33:47.740 --> 33:48.580
are of no consequence.

33:49.340 --> 33:50.340
You are right, though.

33:51.140 --> 33:52.900
To strike at the heart of the threat,

33:54.060 --> 33:56.220
one must first brave the lion's den.

34:00.780 --> 34:01.540
​Shao You.​​

34:07.940 --> 34:09.340
Send men to Gaoyang at once.​​

34:10.820 --> 34:11.260
Understood.

34:15.180 --> 34:16.020
Mr. Xie,

34:17.300 --> 34:18.340
better mind your moves

34:19.380 --> 34:21.380
in this game.

34:22.740 --> 34:24.820
[Prince Xiao Xun's Residence]

34:27.260 --> 34:27.980
Move more to the left.​​

34:28.620 --> 34:29.100
​Raise it higher.​

34:29.100 --> 34:31.220
[Xie Residence]

34:31.220 --> 34:31.620
That's it.

34:32.660 --> 34:33.140
Get down.

34:35.500 --> 34:36.900
With that plaque in place,

34:37.420 --> 34:38.300
the whole estate

34:38.300 --> 34:39.180
seems brighter.

34:39.780 --> 34:40.340
Mr. Xie,

34:40.860 --> 34:41.900
rumors have it

34:42.380 --> 34:43.620
Guard General Chu Ling's negligence

34:43.620 --> 34:44.820
allowed the breach.

34:45.460 --> 34:46.060
Do you think

34:46.380 --> 34:47.620
he'd be like Xiao Xun,

34:48.380 --> 34:49.660
colluding with the enemy?

34:50.820 --> 34:52.460
If Xiao could survive such dire straits,

34:53.180 --> 34:54.300
so can he.

34:55.300 --> 34:56.540
Having spent years at the frontier

34:56.580 --> 34:57.420
with an undefeated record,

34:57.940 --> 34:59.460
the prestige he holds among the people

34:59.940 --> 35:01.340
can not be undone by a single lapse

35:01.380 --> 35:02.140
in judgment.

35:03.020 --> 35:03.980
We may have orchestrated

35:04.020 --> 35:05.260
the invasion,

35:06.140 --> 35:07.340
but his swift

35:07.380 --> 35:08.180
tactical shift

35:08.860 --> 35:10.340
lured the enemy to Xinggu Pass

35:11.700 --> 35:13.100
and secured a total victory.

35:14.020 --> 35:15.300
Many now laud

35:15.980 --> 35:17.260
his braveness and mind.

35:19.300 --> 35:20.460
It seems

35:21.940 --> 35:23.740
we've only served to further his renown.

35:25.020 --> 35:25.540
True.

35:26.060 --> 35:26.740
Just as you are renowned

35:26.780 --> 35:27.740
throughout the land.

35:28.380 --> 35:29.860
Though away from court for years,

35:30.060 --> 35:30.700
your foundation

35:30.700 --> 35:31.980
remains unshakable.

35:33.060 --> 35:33.500
No.

35:35.820 --> 35:36.700
He and I...

35:38.020 --> 35:39.260
have never been the same.

35:41.180 --> 35:42.580
Since the estate is renovated,

35:43.940 --> 35:45.180
send for Yanlai.

35:45.780 --> 35:46.380
Tell him

35:47.500 --> 35:48.820
it is the Master's command

35:49.500 --> 35:51.140
that he return at once.

35:51.860 --> 35:52.460
He's always been

35:52.500 --> 35:53.900
at odds with your family.

35:54.500 --> 35:55.380
Why this?

35:56.060 --> 35:57.140
I am merely curious.

36:00.500 --> 36:02.500
After five years, does the hound...

36:04.420 --> 36:06.340
still know its leash?

36:08.820 --> 36:10.100
​Blessings and calamities coexist.​​

36:10.580 --> 36:11.460
​Great fortune​

36:11.820 --> 36:13.060
​is accompanied by great danger.​

36:13.060 --> 36:14.060
[Chu Tang, Cousin of Chu Zhao]

36:14.060 --> 36:15.260
​This title

36:15.340 --> 36:16.340
may not prove to be

36:16.780 --> 36:17.900
a shield

36:18.340 --> 36:19.700
for the Chu Family.

36:21.420 --> 36:22.060
Of course,

36:22.460 --> 36:23.340
I am grateful

36:23.420 --> 36:24.620
for Uncle's care years ago.

36:25.500 --> 36:26.460
It's just...

36:29.020 --> 36:30.700
Should I fall from this height,

36:31.340 --> 36:32.340
as family,

36:33.020 --> 36:34.900
you will inevitably be implicated.

36:36.220 --> 36:37.060
So,

36:37.620 --> 36:39.100
you'd better plot

36:39.340 --> 36:40.220
your own course.

36:41.020 --> 36:41.700
Zhao,

36:41.940 --> 36:43.060
no need to test me.

36:44.100 --> 36:45.020
From the day

36:45.020 --> 36:46.540
you attained this title,

36:47.620 --> 36:48.900
the Chu Family

36:50.300 --> 36:52.140
rises and falls

36:52.700 --> 36:53.860
with you.

36:56.020 --> 36:56.740
Very well.

36:58.940 --> 36:59.780
Then

37:09.300 --> 37:10.460
from now on,

37:10.940 --> 37:12.100
I shall maneuver in the light,

37:12.980 --> 37:14.220
while you operate in the shadows.

37:15.020 --> 37:16.220
I'll be your fortress,

37:16.620 --> 37:17.700
and you'll be my reach.

37:18.220 --> 37:18.940
​If we win,​​

37:19.340 --> 37:21.100
​we shall share in glory​

37:21.220 --> 37:22.100
​and splendor.​

37:23.340 --> 37:23.900
If we fail...

37:32.540 --> 37:34.380
I am yours to command.

37:35.900 --> 37:38.060
Please keep faith with your pledge.

37:39.020 --> 37:39.940
After this tea,

37:40.860 --> 37:42.140
there is no turning back.

37:50.140 --> 37:51.140
Now that I depart the Capital,

37:51.700 --> 37:52.420
​I must rally

37:52.460 --> 37:53.660
every available ally​

37:54.340 --> 37:55.540
​to hold the court for me.​

37:58.460 --> 38:03.060
♪Broken walls and withered branches,
trapped in the mire♪

38:03.340 --> 38:05.820
♪Yet still striving
to reach for the sky♪

38:05.860 --> 38:09.900
♪My pride is torn down
and my body is sacrificed♪

38:12.140 --> 38:14.260
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

38:14.340 --> 38:16.300
♪And roars in the blaze♪

38:16.380 --> 38:19.620
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

38:19.780 --> 38:22.020
♪Fate imprisons me♪

38:22.180 --> 38:26.980
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

38:26.980 --> 38:31.180
♪Even if hope is faint,
I remain proud♪

38:31.180 --> 38:35.460
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean,
however long it takes♪

38:35.460 --> 38:40.900
♪However it ends up,
I'll go my own way♪

38:40.900 --> 38:42.860
♪With no fear of the distance♪

38:42.860 --> 38:46.580
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

38:46.580 --> 38:51.020
♪With sword in hand,
I'll pierce the dawn♪

38:51.020 --> 38:56.380
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

38:56.380 --> 38:59.980
♪My new pride♪

39:14.780 --> 39:17.680
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

39:17.680 --> 39:20.180
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

39:20.180 --> 39:22.550
♪Amidst the chaos♪

39:22.550 --> 39:26.820
♪I'll always be with you♪

39:28.260 --> 39:30.380
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

39:30.460 --> 39:32.420
♪And roars in the blaze♪

39:32.500 --> 39:35.740
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

39:35.900 --> 39:38.140
♪Fate imprisons me♪

39:38.300 --> 39:43.100
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

39:43.100 --> 39:47.300
♪Even if hope is faint,
I remain proud♪

39:47.300 --> 39:51.580
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean,
however long it takes♪

39:51.580 --> 39:57.020
♪However it ends up,
I'll go my own way♪

39:57.020 --> 39:58.980
♪With no fear of the distance♪

39:58.980 --> 40:02.700
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

40:02.700 --> 40:07.140
♪With sword in hand,
I'll pierce the dawn♪

40:07.140 --> 40:12.500
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

40:12.500 --> 40:16.100
♪My new pride♪
